Subject: [PATCH] Wire indexed development state and bounded header admission

Initialize explicit indexed homes and publish connected headers with state batches. Validate header PoW and contextual ancestry without promoting unexecuted bodies. Expose the index check target in the full build. Integrated Release initializer and disk suites pass; old generic homes fail closed without migration.
